{"text": "That is a good trick, said the hunter, I want to learn it, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So he made himself dark, like the shadows under the trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But what about me, asked the Leopard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Baviaan meant spots on your coat, said the hunter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I do not want to look like the Zebra, said the Leopard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will take spots, but please do not make them too big. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hunter put his five fingers close together. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he pressed them all over the Leopards sandy coat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everywhere they touched, they left five little black marks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now the Leopard could hide anywhere, and the two lived happily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They never changed again, because they were happy just as they were.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", " ", "t", "r", "i", "c", "k", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "u", "n", "t", "e", "r", ",", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "e", "a", "r", "n", " ", "i", "t", ",", " ", "t", "o", "o", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "o", " ", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "h", "i", "m", "s", "e", "l", "f", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", ",", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "m", "e", ",", " ", "a", "s", "k", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "L", "e", "o", "p", "a", "r", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0",